          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्तूपः (stūpaḥ) MW gives stūpa as a knot of hair, a top, and a heap of earth or bricks, especially a Buddhist monument, and reports two old derivations, so its origin is uncertain (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
